1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,180
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) She brings her dress back to the store.

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:05,040
It is too big.

3
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,500
She needs a smaller size.

4
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:11,480
The store does not have a smaller size.

5
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,880
She returns it.

6
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:16,480
She gets her money back.

7
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,920
She sees another dress she likes.

8
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:22,080
It is very pretty.

9
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,380
She buys it.

10
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:27,760
It is cheaper than the other dress.
